{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2b4cbfdf5f9bfaa5d6ca8fa6bdaf8385d9d58527393204ac221f311e96623f0e", "ja": "（環がプロデュースした服のプロモーションで、\nヒーローもののコラボドラマ出演が決まった！）", "zh": "（为了宣传环制作的服装，她决定出演一部英雄题材的联动电视剧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "ddcbc11e584fd6316c12cc3a562946a1e71003707f2f57fd805b98e922928c61", "ja": "おやぶ～ん！　どうしよう！\nたまき、なんだかドキドキしてきちゃったー！", "zh": "老大——！怎么办呀！\n环、感觉心里怦怦跳起来了——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "060cf6bdd648829807541a8f5b2b3a873d5a14c7527bbcee696e633421123f6c", "ja": "うう……むずむずして、じっとしてられないぞ～。\nもしかして、たまき……病気かな～！？", "zh": "呜呜……浑身痒痒的，根本坐不住啦～  \n难道说，环……是生病了吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f18315ef1a40f8e05e0c9326f4f4b6e91e0066417d28373b570ddd36db0c48b2", "ja": "あははっ、病気じゃないよ。たぶん、緊張だと思うよ。\n環、今日の撮影を楽しみにしてたろ？", "zh": "哈哈，不是生病哦。我觉得应该是紧张吧。\n环，你很期待今天的拍摄吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "ebe22430f317136b02479814a389dba707d124c1e5ba6cb2b961dcf451d6c42a", "ja": "うん！　すっごいたのしみ！　ヒーローと一緒に\nドラマに出たら、クラスのみんながびっくりするぞ！", "zh": "嗯！特别期待！要是能和英雄一起出演电视剧，班上的大家肯定会吓一跳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "717c3af91de51c42af1162d38af79a833c44c66062346d3b1927bf2950b972b5", "ja": "くふふ、早く撮影始まらないかな～♪\nおやぶん、たまき大活躍するから見ててね！", "zh": "咕嘿嘿，拍摄怎么还不快点开始呢～♪\n老大，环会大显身手的，记得看哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1006_p", "source_sha256": "01d9ea815971ac7e7be4e4aa7c256a83f7d09595b727fad169423f55e1dd1b3a", "ja": "もちろん！　環が演じる『オシャレな女の子』に\n怪人が一目ぼれしてしまうんだったな。", "zh": "当然了！怪人会对环扮演的“时髦女孩”\n一见钟情，剧情是这样没错吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "3c683d044c593edef40e4c55a6f6aede78bc1ae138a643089b1a0141503383b7", "ja": "ひとめぼれ……は、よくわかんないけど。\nたまきの洋服のPRドラマ、なんだよね？", "zh": "一见钟情……虽然我不太明白是什么意思。\n这是为环的服装做宣传的短剧，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "394095c27c8ee8f81a5a5a28073a9bf31da4d70b203522f8a00b00145a7cfbf9", "ja": "みんながこの服をかっこいいって\n思ってくれるように、がんばるぞ～！", "zh": "为了让大家觉得这件衣服很帅气，\n环会加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "25ddfeaf3f7b644e113fb13c60f9e2e2968f4bf3a914d4f81ec8658432b445da", "ja": "みんなを困らせる悪い怪人め……覚悟しろ～！\nスーパーウルトラパーンチ！", "zh": "让大家为难的坏怪人……做好觉悟吧～！\n超级无敌——拳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1010_p", "source_sha256": "62dad1545a2cef7ad342c4d422f31247a161a25b7da6d460f838e7df85308046", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！\n環が活躍すれば、服もアピールできるしな。", "zh": "对，就是这个劲头！\n只要环大显身手，也能宣传服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "69fd2ba9af0b07849f6ba016775c7cdd58218601ea9c12f96bb5553ce2b42e8d", "ja": "わかった！　……あ、あのねおやぶん。\nたまき、お願いがあるんだけど……。", "zh": "知道了！……啊，那个呀老大。\n环有个请求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "6c99b44c6d37b04f3fbbd1d4be0e5f87cfca6752bc9cad5fff6e22f9f1dc4b28", "ja": "えっとね……\n撮影が終わったら、レッドたちに会いに行っていい？", "zh": "那个……\n拍摄结束后，我可以去见见雷德他们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1013_p", "source_sha256": "16348a03c7133fadf15b8875e8031021eade1df57be9234a1eab677bf7c89177", "ja": "ん？　大丈夫だと思うけど……\nわかった！　サインもらいに行きたいんだな？", "zh": "嗯？我觉得应该没问题，不过……\n我明白了！你是想去找他们要签名吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "d78a93be3ab2e4c39a2aec5e204abacb5afe90025092307a3432458ac72a716d", "ja": "あっ、サインも欲しい……もらう！\nけど……あのね。", "zh": "啊，签名我也想要……我要去拿！\n不过……那个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "fe0228043a85a955c62d541571f0500463fffb580ec92ce7b2e5b3b7e83352e5", "ja": "いつも、平和を守ってくれてありがとうございます。\n応援してますって言いたいんだ～！", "zh": "我想对他们说，\n谢谢你们一直守护和平，我会一直给你们加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2c217025faa4533ffc4c15ed471256f94508b058f54fabe169b116d275ec3fe7", "ja": "環……。\nわかった！　あとで挨拶できるように伝えておくよ。", "zh": "环……。\n知道了！我会先告诉她，待会儿好向你打招呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "ded0d6ebf230d82e110babf5ebb4ad35602f920e01594fa5ba45815ee24aa903", "ja": "やったー！　それじゃ、たまきがんばってくるね！\n怪人なんてやっつけてやるぞー！　くふふ♪", "zh": "太棒啦——！那我这就去努力咯！\n看环把怪人什么的一口气打倒——！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1018_null", "source_sha256": "e4d89fc6fbccb1048bad04205aca5126df69b43affa964347e9189ff37bd4633", "ja": "本番中……", "zh": "演出中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "ec20b33d15c857f64bfc4ed81f5db295925500d639f8a50eb061fd7167cbda47", "ja": "あっ！　レッド、危なーいっ！！\n……今、助けてあげるね！", "zh": "啊！红战士，小心——！！\n……我现在就来救你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1020_p", "source_sha256": "420e2c22937e4399a4f5a47a436768e96134e9bf3fc903823a91bfde15e0533d", "ja": "（た、環？　そんな台詞、台本にないぞ！？）", "zh": "（环、环？这种台词不在剧本里啊！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "99a10e07acad9f4911f83869319a4bb5e16df23901628cf8979d4cc1ecd469f1", "ja": "シュシュッ！　スーパーウルトラパーンチ！", "zh": "咻咻！超级无敌一拳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0554_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cadd91dcade69dc98a8286c4116f2cfcf755cab9d7deef1d4be82d9e36f0f686", "ja": "（撮影終了後、環がヒーロー達に会いに行くと、\nアドリブを褒められ、とても嬉しそうな顔をしていた）", "zh": "（拍摄结束后，环去见英雄们时，因为即兴发挥受到了夸奖，露出了非常开心的表情）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
